 ## Cost anchors (per 1M in → out)
 
-Composer 2.5 $0.5 → $2.5 · Luna $0.2 → $1.2 · Grok 4.6 $2 → $6 · Sol $4 → $20 · Opus 5 $5 → $25 · **Fable 5 $10 → $50** (20x Composer). Fast variants bill roughly 2x, Composer-fast 6x.
